{
  "_comment": [
    "How one report counts towards Reported: the truth table the roadmap states in words",
    "(docs/ROADMAP.md, \"Compatibility reports from others\"). tests/test_community_report.py runs",
    "it against build/community_report.py graded(), the one function that counts: the filer runs",
    "it, and codex-compat-admin imports it from main. A record here is only whether it was",
    "delivered and the state it ended in; the test gives it the rest of a real record. Worked: a",
    "delivered record ended in",
    "recovered. Failed: a delivered record ended in recovery_turn_failed, failed or",
    "terminal_failure. Neither: neither of those, which includes nothing delivered. Both: worked",
    "and failed at once, counted in both columns and shown."
  ],
